    {
      "definition": "requirements.sdk.application_domain",
      "text": [
        "::::{definition} application_domain",
        ":phrase: application domain",
        "",
        ":::{cite} requirements.sdk.domain",
        "An *application domain* is the application's graph, node contents, and evidence",
        "storage, made available together for criterion execution. In the SDK, it",
        "implements [`Domain`](../rustdocs/trust_but_verify/trait.Domain.html) to supply",
        "its shared types, node and edge operations, and evidence persistence.",
        ":::",
        "::::"
      ]
    },
    {
      "definition": "requirements.sdk.graph.node",
      "text": [
        ":::{definition} node",
        ":phrase: graph node",
        "",
        "A *graph node* is a thing identified in the application's graph, such as a",
        "requirement, a function, a test, or an issue. The application's",
        "[`Domain::NodeId`](../../rustdocs/trust_but_verify/trait.Domain.html#associatedtype.NodeId)",
        "identifies it; its contents and the criteria evaluated on it are separate from",
        "that identity.",
        ":::"
      ]
    },
    {
      "definition": "requirements.sdk.graph.node_contents",
      "text": [
        ":::{definition} node_contents",
        ":phrase: node contents",
        "",
        "*Node contents* are the application-defined data read from a",
        "{term}`requirements.sdk.graph.node` as inputs when evaluating a",
        "{term}`requirements.sdk.graph.validation.criterion`. An agent uses these inputs",
        "to assess whether the criterion holds in the project. They can be source text,",
        "parsed code, issue data, or another structured value. In the SDK,",
        "[`Domain::NodeContent`](../../rustdocs/trust_but_verify/trait.Domain.html#associatedtype.NodeContent)",
        "represents this value and",
        "[`Domain::node_content`](../../rustdocs/trust_but_verify/trait.Domain.html#tymethod.node_content)",
        "obtains it. The value implements",
        "[`NodeContents`](../../rustdocs/trust_but_verify/trait.NodeContents.html)",
        "to supply its fingerprint and agent text.",
        ":::"
      ]
    },
    {
      "definition": "requirements.sdk.graph.validation.criterion",
      "text": [
        ":::{definition} criterion",
        ":phrase: criterion",
        "",
        "A *criterion* is a value describing a test to perform on a",
        "{term}`requirements.sdk.graph.node`.",
        "In the SDK, its type implements",
        "[`Criterion<D>`](../../../rustdocs/trust_but_verify/trait.Criterion.html) for the",
        "{term}`requirements.sdk.application_domain`. Its",
        "members describe the question's answer, identity, review rules, and execution.",
        ":::"
      ]
    },
